OL,3,GNEWSACoroner's concerns over delays    
OL,4,Aafter baby's death                     
OL,6,FA coroner has raised concerns about    
OL,7,Fambulance and medical delays after a   
OL,8,F19-day-old baby boy died from sepsis   
OL,9,Fand meningitis.                        
OL,11,FSixteen days after Ezrah Pollard's     
OL,12,Fbirth in March 2022 he became unwell   
OL,13,Fand was grizzly, not feeding and having
OL,14,Fa foul nappy.                          
OL,16,FA Truro inquest heard he developed a   
OL,17,Ffever and a 111 call was transferred to
OL,18,Fthe South Western Ambulance Service    
OL,19,FTrust (SWAST) which said he needed an  
OL,20,Fambulance response which should have   
OL,21,Farrived within 18 minutes.             
