OL,3,GNEWSACoroner's concerns over delays    
OL,4,Aafter baby's death                     
OL,6,FAn ambulance was chased over an hour   
OL,7,Flater but it was not dispatched due to 
OL,8,Foperational pressures - at the time of 
OL,9,Fthe incident they were taking four     
OL,10,Fhours on average to respond to cases in
OL,11,Fthe same category.                     
